.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH voa-config-show 1  "voa-config-show " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
voa\-config\-show \- Show OS or context\-level technology settings.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBvoa config show\fR [\fB\-\-purpose\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-context\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR]... [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOS\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Show OS or context\-level technology settings.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-purpose\fR \fI<PURPOSE>\fR
The purpose to search for.
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBVOA_CONFIG_SHOW_PURPOSE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Increase logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-\-context\fR \fI<CONTEXT>\fR
The context to search for.

If not specified, defaults to "default".
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBVOA_CONFIG_SHOW_CONTEXT\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Decrease logging verbosity
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\-format\fR \fI<OUTPUT_FORMAT>\fR [default: text]
The output format to use.
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json: The JSON output format
.IP \(bu 2
text: The default text output format
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBVOA_CONFIG_SHOW_OUTPUT_FORMAT\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIOS\fR>
The OS to search for.
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBVOA_CONFIG_SHOW_OS\fR environment variable. 
.RE
